<title>FRANCE: Labinal first quarter sales slip.</title>
<headline>Labinal first quarter sales slip.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-05-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>First quarter 1997</p>
<p>(All figures in millions of French francs)</p>
<p>    Turnover				    2,947   vs  2,971</p>
<p>    Parent company				386   vs    378</p>
<p>NOTE - Labinal said in a newspaper notice that all its automobile supply divisions showed a drop in sales while its aeronautic divisions continued to show turnover growth.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
</text>
